 - Writes require the `contributor` or `manager` role in the project. Users who can read but not write get 403.
 - Contributors may only modify tasks assigned to themselves, and may not reassign tasks. Managers may modify any task.
 - Only managers may delete tasks.
+- Only managers may freeze a project. Freezing sets every member (managers included) to `viewer`, so nobody can change the project's tasks afterwards. Freezing also clears the assignee of every task in the project, because a viewer may not be an assignee. Freezing an archived project → 409.
